# TiBrain — Allowlist .gitignore
# Only push: *.md *.go *.yml *.json *.sh *.cmd *.bat *.ps1
# Plus: Makefile, Dockerfile, .gitignore, .gitattributes, .gitkeep

# Ignore everything by default
*

# Hard block: directories (match at any depth)
**/node_modules/
/.git/
/.claude/
/.venv/
/__pycache__/
**/.kilo/
**/.runtime/
**/.ti-audit/
/logs/
/bin/
/tmp/
.ti*
**/.ti*
**/.codex*
**/.sisyphus*

# Skip learning lab runtime artifacts
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/.agent/**
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/active/**
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/Antigravity/**

# Skip provider cookie docs (contain hardcoded API tokens)
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/03_Knowledge/Router/CookieProviders/
# Skip broader Router knowledge dir (also contains API keys in *.md)
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/03_Knowledge/Router/
# Skip entire 03_Knowledge (provider integration docs w/ API keys)
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/03_Knowledge/
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/Cursor-Trial-Hub/

# Skip embedded git repositories (not submodules) - override dir allowlist
**/mcp/**
**/obsidian-headless/**
**/qdrant/**

# Skip learning lab runtime artifacts (override file-type allowlist)
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/.agent/**
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/active/**
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/Antigravity/**

# Skip provider cookie/docs (override file-type allowlist)
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/03_Knowledge/Router/CookieProviders/
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/03_Knowledge/Router/
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/03_Knowledge/
**/knowledge/ti-ecosystem-docs/content/skills/Ti-learning-lab/06_HandsOn/Cursor-Trial-Hub/